                                                "sense_id": "bc5064bb-a590-3193-8d94-ea8e21174915",
                                                "text": "No seats were used yet and the pilot of the airboat stood by the engine and operated the throttle manually. Later, a stick control similar to that used in small aircraft was attached to the rudder ropes."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3e378b34-493c-4c8f-92a4-eda9ae8c8106",
                                                "sense_id": "bc5064bb-a590-3193-8d94-ea8e21174915",
                                                "text": "In keeping with that mission, the law called for the use of airboats in the national park to be phased out."
